@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@
+Feature: Adding todos
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want to add new todos by typing in the input field
+  So that I can track things I need to do
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Creating a new todo on Enter
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the first todo has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace from new todo titles
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "  Buy milk  " in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Ignoring empty input
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Ignoring whitespace-only input
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "   " in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Clearing the input after adding a todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the new todo input is empty
+
+  Scenario: Focusing the new todo input on page load
+    Then the new todo input is focused
+
+  Scenario: Adding multiple todos
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    And the user types "Walk the dog" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 2 items
+    And the first todo has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+    And the second todo has title "Walk the dog" and is not completed
