@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+Feature: Clear completed
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want to remove all completed todos at once
+  So that I can clean up my task list
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Clearing completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    And the user has completed the todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user clicks "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the first todo has title "Walk the dog" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when at least one todo is completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has completed the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is visible
diff --git a/features/counter-and-visibility.feature b/features/counter-and-visibility.feature
