@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@
+Feature: Editing todos
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want to edit the title of an existing todo
+  So that I can correct or update task descriptions
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Entering edit mode on double-click
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    And the edit input for "Buy milk" is focused
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit on Enter
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    And the user types "Buy almond milk" in the edit input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the first todo has title "Buy almond milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit on blur
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    And the user types "Buy almond milk" in the edit input and blurs
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy almond milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Discarding an edit on Escape
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    And the user types "Buy almond milk" in the edit input and presses Escape
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Deleting a todo when the edit input is empty
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    And the user clears the edit input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace from edited titles
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    And the user types "  Buy almond milk  " in the edit input and presses Enter
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy almond milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Removing editing class after save
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo "Buy milk" label
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    When the user types "Buy almond milk" in the edit input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo "Buy almond milk" is not in editing mode
diff --git a/features/filtering-todos.feature b/features/filtering-todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f1f438a
