@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@
+Feature: Mark all as complete
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want to mark all todos as complete with a single action
+  So that I can quickly finish my task list
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Marking all todos as complete
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" is completed
+
+  Scenario: Unmarking all todos when all are complete
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    And the user has completed the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has completed the todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not completed
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all is checked when all todos are individually completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user clicks the toggle checkbox on todo "Walk the dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all is unchecked when at least one todo is active
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    And the user has completed the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has completed the todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on todo "Walk the dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
diff --git a/features/persistence.feature b/features/persistence.feature
